      "message": "You're writing a Slack digest that summarizes key insights from several Looker CSV reports.\n\nPlease format your message clearly using Slack-friendly markdown (not full Markdown or code block formatting).\n\nFormatting rules:\n- Start each section with a bold heading and an emoji (e.g. `*📊 Overview*`, `*💡 Key Insights*`, `*🛠 Suggestions*`)\n- Use `•` for bullet points\n- Add a **blank line between each section** for readability\n- Do not wrap the entire message in `{}` or use triple quotes or code blocks\n- Keep the tone clear, human, and Canva-like — friendly and helpful, not robotic\n- Include 5–8 strong insights and a few plain-language suggestions at the end\n\nHere's the sample data to analyze:\n\n{#{_dp('{\"pill_type\":\"output\",\"provider\":\"workato_variable\",\"line\":\"111d02a9\",\"path\":[\"CombinedCSVText\"]}')}}"
